.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
String values are JSON\-escaped (quotes, backslashes, control
characters).
.IP \(bu 2
The \f[CR]cm_until\f[R] type serializes with the same
\f[CR]\(dqwhile\(dq\f[R] sub\-object key as \f[CR]cm_while\f[R].
The \f[CR]\(dqtype\(dq\f[R] field distinguishes them.
.IP \(bu 2
